Once upon a time there was an enthusiastic young cop. He was always happy to help out in the town. He matched different fans and helped answers to pretend problem. One day, he was walking around town when he heard a loud scream from somewhere. It was so loud that he knew he had to find out who was screaming. He followed the sound of a big dog and it soon came to a house. Inside was a little child crying. The little cop ran over to the call and saw that there was a big cat rid of the puppy. He ran to the window and asked the child if they had seen a bone. The child shook their heads, they had not seen a rat this time. The little cop reached out to the little girl and held out a bone for the child to see. The child was so excited! With the help of the little girl, he was able to see inside the house with the bone in one piece.

